  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "e7228f38-acb5-374c-9bda-1ec0d6267ee1"],
 " is a nonsingular 2 by 2 or 3 by 3 matrix whose rows are real-space lattice \
vectors."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->265095848,ExpressionUUID->"7eefeefd-ee99-0242-8eb2-b8cc6ff3fabb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The output uses the same row-vector convention. Each real-space basis \
vector has dot product ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"2", " ", "\[Pi]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "442efd41-3548-4544-aa5b-e7fa301e2d41"],
 " with its corresponding reciprocal vector and zero dot product with the \
others."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->449742921,ExpressionUUID->"a831a9d6-ab8a-494f-89de-26f56bac582e"],

Cell["\<\
The two-dimensional implementation embeds the basis in three dimensions and \
removes the auxiliary direction.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->495299152,ExpressionUUID->"c50b81f2-eb93-ff49-8b1b-a9e4dca53fe9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Writing the input and output basis vectors as rows of A and B, \
respectively,",
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TagBox[
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"A", ".", 
      TemplateBox[{"B"},
       "Transpose"]}], "\[LongEqual]", 
     RowBox[{"2", " ", "\[Pi]", " ", "\[DoubleStruckCapitalI]"}]}],
    HoldForm], TraditionalForm]], "InlineMath",
  ScriptLevel->0,
  FontSize->14,
  FractionBoxOptions->{BaseStyle->{ScriptLevel -> 0}},ExpressionUUID->
  "ac6db6ec-7c53-714e-8a13-6a85b2d4bd1e"]
}], "Notes",
 CellID->236160399,ExpressionUUID->"acb2fc7c-ff7b-224d-b216-89cf76d5c77c"]
}, Closed]],

